# head/adult/woman/brow_arched: the woman's arched brows (A3): 2 px over each eye in hair step 1
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role brow arched
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -4 -8
|bb....bb

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -11 -8
|b

view L key rest origin -4 -8
|b
